## AI-Native Development

This project was built using Claude as an AI coding assistant.
All AI-generated code was reviewed before being committed.

Key review decisions are documented in [docs/AI_REVIEW_LOG.md](docs/AI_REVIEW_LOG.md).

The [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) file provides instructions for AI assistants
working on this codebase, including the withTenant() discipline and
RLS rules for adding new tables.

## Azure Compatibility

This project uses free-tier services for deployment (Vercel, Render, Neon)
but is designed to be Azure-compatible. The same architecture can be moved to:

- Azure App Service (backend)
- Azure Static Web Apps (frontend)
- Azure Database for PostgreSQL (database)

without any code changes.

